# Project input documents, not deliverables.
# The master build prompt, the PRD and the Concept Note are Bounty Farm's own
# documents and were the INPUT to this repository, not its output. They stay in
# the working directory so the build can be re-derived from them, and out of
# version control so a public repository does not republish Bounty Farm's
# internal papers. Their requirements are traced in docs/traceability-matrix.md.
BFF_Claude_Code_Master_Prompt.md
BFF_Digital_Sample_Testing_PRD.md
BFF_Digital_Sample_Testing_Concept_Note.md

